2618	2630	2595	2595	German	213	“ A striking girl — that Miss Harleth — unlike others . ”
2631	2662	2595	2595	German	213	“ Yes , she has got herself up as a sort of serpent now — all green and silver , and winds her neck about a little more than usual . ”
2663	2693	2595	2595	German	213	“ Oh , she must always be doing something extraordinary . She is that kind of girl , I fancy . Do you think her pretty , Mr. Vandernoodt ? ”
