2796	2858	2595	2595	German	213	“ On the contrary , I think her complexion one of her chief charms . It is a warm paleness ; it looks thoroughly healthy . And that delicate nose with its gradual little upward curve is distracting . And then her mouth — there never was a prettier mouth , the lips curled backward so finely , eh , Mackworth ? ”
