292592	292792	292578	292578	she	438	“ I want to tell you ; I can not tell any one else . I could not have told my own mother : I should have closed it up before her . I feel shame for my father , and it is perhaps strange — but the shame is greater before Ezra than before any one else in the world . He desired me to tell him all about my life , and I obeyed him . But it is always like a smart to me to know that those things about my father are in Ezra ’s mind . And — can you believe it ? when the thought haunts me how it would be if my father were to come and show himself before us both , what seems as if it would scorch me most is seeing my father shrinking before Ezra . That is the truth . I do n’t know whether it is a right feeling . But I ca n’t help thinking that I would rather try to maintain my father in secret , and bear a great deal in that way , if I could hinder him from meeting my brother . ”
