324740	324881	324603	324603	Kalonymos	728	“ Good ! Me you will hardly find , for I am beyond my threescore years and ten , and I am a wanderer , carrying my shroud with me . But my sons and their children dwell here in wealth and unity . The days are changed for us since Karl the Great fetched my ancestors from Italy to bring some tincture of knowledge to our rough German brethren . I and my contemporaries have had to fight for it too . Our youth fell on evil days ; but this we have won ; we increase our wealth in safety , and the learning of all Germany is fed and fattened by Jewish brains — though they keep not always their Jewish hearts . Have you been left altogether ignorant of your people ’s life , young man ? ”
